Subject: [PATCH] [M159] Do not show login prompt for uncommitted navigations

Original change's description:
> Do not show login prompt for uncommitted navigations
>
> LoginTabHelper::DidFinishNavigation() displays a login prompt over the blank error page committed when an unauthorized response is received. If a navigation finishes without committing, the previous document remains in place and no prompt should be shown.
>
